{"seq":1,"slug":"product-carbon-footprint-lca-model","title":"产品碳足迹 PCF/LCA 建模与数据来源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carbon-neutral-green-shipping-estimation-options/carbon-label-product-data/product-carbon-footprint-lca-model","wordCount":2559,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"产品碳足迹-pcf-lca-建模与数据来源\">产品碳足迹 PCF/LCA 建模与数据来源</h1><p>一个跨境卖家的商品页上写着「本产品碳足迹 4.2 kg CO₂e」，这个数字背后的工作量远大于它占用的版面：要回溯到原材料开采的供应商、把 BOM 里上百个零件映射到上千条过程记录、选定一款数据库、跑一遍生命周期影响评价，最后承认结果带 ±30% 的不确定度。这一篇讲这个数字是怎么从物料清单长出来的，以及 2026 年商品碳数据正在从「自算自贴」转向「供应链交换」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>产品碳足迹（PCF, Product Carbon Footprint）是<strong>只算气候变化这一个影响类别</strong>的简化 LCA：生命周期评价（LCA, Life Cycle Assessment）评估酸化、富营养化、水耗等多项环境影响，PCF 只取其中的全球变暖潜势（GWP），单位是千克二氧化碳当量（kg CO₂e）。这个简化正是它可以被标准化、被商品数据交换格式承载的原因——单指标才能塞进一张属性表。</p>\n<p>规则层面有两套并行体系：ISO 体系（ISO 14040/14044 定 LCA 框架，ISO 14067:2018 定 PCF 量化要求）与 GHG Protocol 体系（《Product Life Cycle Accounting and Reporting Standard》，2011 年发布，配套《Corporate Standard》与《Scope 3 Standard》）。方法论口径几乎一致，差异在报告与披露偏好：ISO 14067 是认证用的要求标准，GHG Protocol 更贴近企业盘查。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[目标与范围定义&lt;br/&gt;Goal and Scope] --&gt; B[生命周期清单分析&lt;br/&gt;LCI]&#10;  B --&gt; C[生命周期影响评价&lt;br/&gt;LCIA]&#10;  C --&gt; D[结果解释&lt;br/&gt;Interpretation]&#10;  D --&gt;|发现热点或数据缺口| A&#10;  D --&gt; E[PCF 结果 kg CO2e]&#10;  E --&gt; F[第三方验证 ISO 14067]&#10;  F --&gt; G[碳标签 / EPD]&#10;  E --&gt; H[供应链数据交换&lt;br/&gt;PACT / Catena-X]&#10;  G --&gt; I[商品页与合规申报]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[目标与范围定义&lt;br/&gt;Goal and Scope] --&gt; B[生命周期清单分析&lt;br/&gt;LCI]\n  B --&gt; C[生命周期影响评价&lt;br/&gt;LCIA]\n  C --&gt; D[结果解释&lt;br/&gt;Interpretation]\n  D --&gt;|发现热点或数据缺口| A\n  D --&gt; E[PCF 结果 kg CO2e]\n  E --&gt; F[第三方验证 ISO 14067]\n  F --&gt; G[碳标签 / EPD]\n  E --&gt; H[供应链数据交换&lt;br/&gt;PACT / Catena-X]\n  G --&gt; I[商品页与合规申报]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>图里关键的一点是左侧的回环：LCA 不是单向流水线，Interpretation 阶段一旦发现某个过程贡献了 60% 的排放却用的是最粗的二手数据，就必须回到范围定义去补一手数据，否则结论站不住。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>发布机构</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>商品碳数据的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ISO 14067:2018</td>\n<td>ISO</td>\n<td>PCF 量化的要求与指南</td>\n<td>认证与验证的依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ISO 14040/14044</td>\n<td>ISO</td>\n<td>LCA 通用框架</td>\n<td>给 PCF 提供方法论母体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GHG Protocol Product Standard</td>\n<td>WRI / WBCSD</td>\n<td>产品全生命周期盘查</td>\n<td>企业报告口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PEF Method</td>\n<td>欧盟委员会</td>\n<td>产品环境足迹（多指标）</td>\n<td>欧盟政策与标签的方法底座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PAS 2050</td>\n<td>BSI</td>\n<td>早期 PCF 规范（已被 ISO 14067 取代）</td>\n<td>历史方法，认证已转向 ISO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>各框架对「必须包含哪些阶段」的口径不同：ISO 14067 要求覆盖全部生命周期阶段，除非有明显豁免理由；GHG Protocol 允许在某些类别不显著时排除。<strong>选框架就是选你在哪一场合规辩论里能被认可</strong>，不是选一个算得更小的口径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四步法-从边界到可解释的结果\">四步法：从边界到可解释的结果</h2><h3 id=\"目标与范围-goal-and-scope\">目标与范围（Goal and Scope）</h3><p>这一步产出三件事：功能单位、系统边界、取舍规则。功能单位（functional unit）是「比较的基准」——不是「1 个瓶子」而是「盛装 500 mL 液体并能承受 2 米跌落 1 次」，因为包装方案的碳优劣必须建立在等效功能上，否则轻量化永远赢。系统边界通常用「从摇篮到大门」（cradle-to-gate，到工厂出货为止）或「从摇篮到坟墓」（cradle-to-grave，含使用与废弃）；跨境商品若要在商品页披露含配送的碳足迹，还需叠加运输阶段，而这部分的链路边界与 <a href=\"../carbon-accounting-methodology/emission-scope-boundary-glec-model\">物流碳排放核算边界与 GLEC 框架模型</a> 的划分必须一致，否则两处数字对不上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生命周期清单-lci\">生命周期清单（LCI）</h3><p>清单分析是<strong>最耗人力的一步</strong>：把 BOM 展开成过程记录，再为每条记录配一个活动数据与排放因子。合成一件 T 恤要列出棉花种植、纺纱、织造、染整、成衣、运输各段，每段的投入（电、水、化学品）都要有出处。结果是这个过程最容易退化为「拍脑袋填库值」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"影响评价-lcia\">影响评价（LCIA）</h3><p>LCIA 把清单里的物质流乘以特征化因子换算成 GWP。常用因子集是 IPCC AR6 的 100 年 GWP（GWP₁₀₀），例如甲烷按 27–30、氧化亚氮按 273 计（<a href=\"https://www.ipcc.ch/report/ar6/wg1/\">IPCC AR6 WG1</a>）。<strong>因子集必须与数据源的因子集一致</strong>——混用 AR5 和 AR6 会产生系统性偏差，且偏差随时间拉大，报告里必须写明用的哪一套。</p>\n<h3 id=\"结果解释与不确定性\">结果解释与不确定性</h3><p>解释阶段回答两个问题：哪个过程是热点，结果有多可信。热点识别用帕累托思路——通常前三个过程贡献 60% 以上排放，改进应集中于此。不确定性则来自四类：活动数据代表性、因子数据库的地理/技术代表性、分配方法选择、模型简化。ISO 14067 要求做敏感性分析并报告局限，不能只给一个光秃秃的数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pcf-计算模型与分配问题\">PCF 计算模型与分配问题</h2><p>PCF 的算式本身简单——活动数据乘以排放因子再累加：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PCF_{product} = \\sum_{i} AD_i \\times EF_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>真难点在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AD_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（活动数据）从哪来，以及一个车间产多种产品时，排放怎么切。分配（allocation）是 PCF 最易被操纵也最需要透明的地方。质量分配按产出重量比例切：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_{product} = \\frac{m_{product}}{m_{total}}, \\qquad E_{product} = \\alpha_{product} \\cdot E_{process}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ocess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但质量分配对高附加值、低质量的商品（芯片、药）会严重低估其真实环境代价，因为制造能耗并不与重量成正比。更贴近因果的是<strong>物理分配</strong>（按加工时间、按能耗设备占用）或<strong>经济分配</strong>（按产值），而 ISO 14044 的优先级是：先避免分配（细化过程单元），再物理，再其他关系，最后才经济。跨境场景里还有个隐藏分配：同一票货里混装多 SKU 的干线与尾程排放，应按重量×里程分摊到每个 SKU，这与 <a href=\"../carbon-accounting-methodology/emission-factor-transport-mode-chain\">排放因子与多式联运分段核算链</a> 给出的分段因子口径保持一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据来源-一手-二手-数据库的取舍\">数据来源：一手、二手、数据库的取舍</h2><p>排放因子的质量决定了 PCF 的质量。行业惯例把它排序为三层，越靠前三方验证越容易通过：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一手数据（供应商特定）</td>\n<td>供应商实测电耗、物料清单、现场表计</td>\n<td>热点过程（通常前 3–5 项）</td>\n<td>收集成本高、需上游配合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二手·行业平均</td>\n<td>ecoinvent、GaBi/Sphera、ADEME Base Empreinte</td>\n<td>非热点、通用材料</td>\n<td>地理/技术代表性偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二手·估算</td>\n<td>文献值、专家判断、类比</td>\n<td>数据完全缺失时的兜底</td>\n<td>不确定性最大，需明示</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一手数据与二手数据库的差距不是学术问题。Catena-X 汽车数据生态公开的一个案例显示，用供应链一手 PCF 数据替代行业平均值后，报告值下降了 <strong>46%</strong>（<a href=\"https://catena-x.net/en/\">Catena-X PCF</a>，SAP Sustainability Data Exchange 案例）——差距主要来自数据库默认的通用工艺是高耗能路径，而真实供应商早已改造。这说明<strong>用二手库算出的 PCF 常常是「保守高估」，用它做减碳决策会误导投入方向</strong>。</p>\n<p>主流二手数据库里，ecoinvent 是学术与工业界覆盖最广的一套（瑞士，v3.x 系列），Sphera（原 GaBi）偏工业流程，法国 ADEME 的 Base Empreinte 提供本国官方因子（<a href=\"https://base-empreinte.ademe.fr/\">ADEME Base Empreinte</a>）。选库时要看<strong>地理代表性与技术代表性</strong>是否匹配你的供应链：用欧洲电网因子算中国工厂用电会系统性偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交换格式-从静态标签到供应链数据流\">交换格式：从静态标签到供应链数据流</h2><p>2026 年最大的变化是商品碳数据开始<strong>格式化、可机读、可交换</strong>，而不是一张印在包装上的静态标签。三条线在推进：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PACT Pathfinder Framework</strong>（WBCSD 主导，<a href=\"https://www.wbcsd.org/\">WBCSD PACT</a>) 定义了 PCF 数据的交换结构（产品标识、边界、方法、每阶段排放、数据质量评分），目标是让买方从供应商处按统一 schema 拉取 PCF，而非每家一套 Excel。</li>\n<li><strong>Catena-X PCF Rulebook</strong>（德国汽车产业数据生态）把 PACT 思想落到行业规则，通过数据空间在 OEM 与 Tier-N 之间交换，强调按需访问与身份验证。</li>\n<li><strong>EU PEF / ESPR</strong>：欧盟《可持续产品生态设计法规》(ESPR, Regulation (EU) 2024/1781) 推动数字产品护照（DPP），把产品环境数据随产品流转；<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1542/oj\">欧盟电池法规 (EU) 2023/1542</a> 已要求动力电池申报碳足迹。PEF 方法与 ISO 14067 的差异在于 PEF 覆盖 16 个影响类别且规定更细的建模规则。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对跨境卖家，这些格式化的直接含义是：<strong>商品碳数据正在变成一张要和供应商对接的数据表，而不是市场部自己做的一张图</strong>。数据交换里的字段（功能单位、边界、数据质量评级、验证状态）会反向约束你怎么做 LCA——一开始就按目标格式建模，比事后补字段便宜得多。跨境电商里配送阶段的碳数据格式与 <a href=\"../green-shipping-options/green-delivery-option-taxonomy\">绿色配送选项分类与适用边界</a> 披露的结账页选项共享同一批排放强度输入，格式对齐能省一次数据清洗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PCF 是只算 GWP 的单指标 LCA，由 ISO 14067:2018 与 GHG Protocol Product Standard 两套并行规则约束；方法差异在于报告口径而非物理核算。</li>\n<li>四步法（范围→清单→影响评价→解释）的关键不在算式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PCF=\\sum AD_i \\times EF_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而在边界定义、数据来源与分配方法的透明。</li>\n<li>分配优先级：避免 &gt; 物理 &gt; 其他关系 &gt; 经济；经济分配会低估高附加值轻质量商品。</li>\n<li>排放因子分一手、二手行业库、估算三层；热点过程必须用一手数据，否则结论不可用于减碳决策（一手替代平均值的案例中报告值可降约 46%）。</li>\n<li>因子集（如 IPCC AR6 GWP₁₀₀）必须与数据源一致并明示，混用会带来系统性偏差。</li>\n<li>2026 年趋势是商品碳数据格式化交换（PACT Pathfinder、Catena-X、EU PEF/ESPR 数字产品护照），应按目标格式建模以降低对接成本。</li>\n<li>PCF 与物流碳核算共享链路边界口径，运输阶段数据需与 GLEC 框架侧对齐，否则商品页与物流报告的数字会互相矛盾。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"产品碳足迹 PCF/LCA 建模与数据来源","id":"产品碳足迹-pcf-lca-建模与数据来源"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四步法：从边界到可解释的结果","id":"四步法-从边界到可解释的结果"},{"level":3,"text":"目标与范围（Goal and Scope）","id":"目标与范围-goal-and-scope"},{"level":3,"text":"生命周期清单（LCI）","id":"生命周期清单-lci"},{"level":3,"text":"影响评价（LCIA）","id":"影响评价-lcia"},{"level":3,"text":"结果解释与不确定性","id":"结果解释与不确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"PCF 计算模型与分配问题","id":"pcf-计算模型与分配问题"},{"level":2,"text":"数据来源：一手、二手、数据库的取舍","id":"数据来源-一手-二手-数据库的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"交换格式：从静态标签到供应链数据流","id":"交换格式-从静态标签到供应链数据流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"结账页绿色选项定价、激励与时效权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carbon-neutral-green-shipping-estimation-options/green-shipping-options/green-option-checkout-pricing-sla"},"next":{"title":"碳标签等级、认证标准与核证流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carbon-neutral-green-shipping-estimation-options/carbon-label-product-data/carbon-label-certification-standards"}}